=== sg_emc_trespass ===
DESCRIPTION ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Unrecognized switch: --help


USAGE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  sg_emc_trespass [-d] [-hr] [-s] [-V] DEVICE


POSITIONALS (1) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  DEVICE  sg or block device (latter in lk 2.6 or lk 3 series)


FLAGS (4) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-d    output debug
-h r  Set Honor Reservation bit
-s    Send Short Trespass Command page (default: long) (for FC series)
-V    print version string then exit DEVICE sg or block device (latter in lk
      2.6 or lk 3 series) Example: sg_emc_trespass /dev/sda
